graph TB
    subgraph "MCP Lifecycle Operator"
        Controller["mcpserver-controller<br/>(controller-runtime)"]
        Handshake["MCP Handshake Client<br/>(go-sdk StreamableHTTP)"]
        ConfigHash["Config Hash Computer<br/>(SHA-256)"]
        Validation["Validation Logic"]
        Ownership["Ownership Manager"]
        Metrics["Metrics Server<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS"]
        HealthProbes["Health Probes<br/>8081/TCP HTTP<br/>/healthz /readyz"]
    end

    User[User / Platform] -->|creates| MCPServerCR["MCPServer CR<br/>mcp.x-k8s.io/v1alpha1"]

    MCPServerCR -->|watched by| Controller
    Controller -->|validates spec| Validation
    Validation -->|reads| ConfigMaps["ConfigMaps"]
    Validation -->|reads| Secrets["Secrets"]

    Controller -->|computes| ConfigHash
    ConfigHash -->|reads data from| ConfigMaps
    ConfigHash -->|reads data from| Secrets

    Controller -->|checks ownership| Ownership

    Controller -->|creates/updates| Deployment["Deployment<br/>(MCP server pod)"]
    Controller -->|creates/updates| Service["ClusterIP Service<br/>{mcpserver-name}"]
    Controller -->|creates/updates| NetworkPolicy["NetworkPolicy<br/>(MCP port ingress)"]

    Controller -->|initiates| Handshake
    Handshake -->|MCP initialize| MCPPod["MCP Server Pod<br/>{spec.config.port}/TCP"]
    Handshake -->|populates status with<br/>ServerInfo + capabilities| MCPServerCR

    ConfigMaps -->|change triggers| Controller
    Secrets -->|change triggers| Controller

    Prometheus["Prometheus /<br/>OpenShift Monitoring"] -->|scrapes| Metrics

    Controller -->|CRUD| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS"]

    style Controller fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Handshake fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style ConfigHash fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Validation fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Ownership fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style Metrics fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style HealthProbes fill:#4a90e2,stroke:#333,color:#fff
    style MCPServerCR fill:#f5a623,stroke:#333
    style Deployment fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style Service fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style NetworkPolicy fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style MCPPod fill:#7ed321,stroke:#333
    style ConfigMaps fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style Secrets fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style K8sAPI fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
    style Prometheus fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333
